Package: HealthSystemCoverage
Type: Package
Title: Profile Health-System Coverage in OMOP Data Sources
Version: 0.2.7
Authors@R: person("ibaitamayo", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "ibai.tamayo.rodriguez@navarra.es")
Description: Produces an auditable profile of which parts of a health system
    are represented in an OMOP Common Data Model database. The profile is
    organised around logical health-system functions rather than OMOP tables,
    and distinguishes presence, structure, semantic reliability, provenance,
    time coverage, and known defects. Supports OHDSI cohort membership,
    explicit quality review and local event logs for observed care trajectories.
    Report bundles contain aggregate results only.
